\'97}{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
Yo no lo tengo.}
\par \li1371\ri0\lin1371\rin0\fi0\sl12\slmult1\sb41\sa0\pard\plain \s26\li1371\ri0\lin1371\rin0\fi0\sb41\sa0\hich\af3\dbch\af3\afs29\loch\f3\fs29\sl266\slmult1\qj\li940\ri999\lin940\rin999\fi431{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
